# ==========================================================
# 📜 COUPON USAGE HISTORY APIs
# ==========================================================

### Create Usage History (Manual Entry)
POST {{baseUrl}}/coupon/usage-history
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "coupon_id": "{{couponId}}",
  "coupon_code": "{{couponCode}}",
  "customer_id": "{{customerId}}",
  "customer_code": "A001",
  "customer_name": "นายทดสอบ ระบบ",
  "sale_invoice_id": "INV-{{transactionId}}",
  "sale_invoice_number": "IV202506200001",
  "transaction_id": "{{transactionId}}",
  "reservation_id": "{{reservationId}}",
  "used_amount": 100.00,
  "discount_amount": 100.00,
  "cash_voucher_amount": 0.00,
  "order_amount": 1500.00,
  "coupon_type": 0,
  "coupon_value": 100.00,
  "remark": "ทดสอบการบันทึกประวัติการใช้คูปอง"
}

###

### Get All Usage History (with pagination)
POST {{baseUrl}}/coupon/usage-history/search
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "page": 1,
  "page_size": 20
}

###

### Get Usage History by Coupon
GET {{baseUrl}}/coupon/usage-history/by-coupon?coupon_id={{couponId}}&page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Get Usage History by Customer
GET {{baseUrl}}/coupon/customer/usage-history?customer_id={{customerId}}&page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Get Usage History by Sale Invoice
GET {{baseUrl}}/coupon/sale-invoice/usage-history?sale_invoice_id=INV-{{transactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Get Usage History by Transaction ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/coupon/transaction/usage-history?transaction_id={{transactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Search Usage History with Filters
POST {{baseUrl}}/coupon/usage-history/search
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "coupon_code": "TEST",
  "customer_id": "{{customerId}}",
  "start_date": "2025-06-01T00:00:00Z",
  "end_date": "2025-06-30T23:59:59Z",
  "page": 1,
  "page_size": 20
}

# ==========================================================
# 📋 TROUBLESHOOTING TIPS
# ==========================================================

# 🔧 **Common Issues:**
# - **401 Unauthorized**: Check access token validity
# - **Coupon not found**: Verify coupon ID in variables
# - **Expired coupon**: Check issueddate/expirydate in UTC
# - **Insufficient value**: Check remainingvalue vs use_amount
# - **Reservation expired**: Reservations expire in 15 minutes

# 🎯 **Best Practices:**
# - Update @couponId after creating coupons
# - Update @reservationId after reserving
# - Use UTC timestamps for dates
# - Test with small amounts first
# - Clean up test data after testing

